    <span class="nh">In one line</span>
    A database keeps values; an ontology keeps <strong>what those values mean, how they connect, and which rules they obey</strong>. With this layer between legacy and generative AI, a probabilistic model becomes usable for deterministic work. For cases, ROI, and the build process, see <a href="#!gdb-onto-adoption">the practice part</a>.
